Drop expired-activity switches (charity red flower 2026090901, qingmei
20260812xx) and add the live share-reward activity (快乐不独享
2026110104, part of the milk-tea group 2026110100): auto share / claim
daily happiness / claim milestone rewards via share-reward-activity.

Final switch set: activity_battle_pass_claim (dynamic current season),
activity_share_reward, activity_milk_tea_fund_claim.
